{"id": "safehouse-client-stipends-and-housing-loan", "title": "SafeHouse reported $29,400 taken from a state grant for client stipends", "seconds": 58.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.024, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "ec446ff96d424288", "words": 144, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The sponsor reported that an employee took state grant money from the client stipend account.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.29, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "happened", "to", "the", "stipends?"], "sub": "San Francisco SafeHouse"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.64, 1.13, 1.31, 1.41, 2.15, 2.48, 2.85, 3.18, 3.45, 3.62, 3.73, 4.19, 4.62]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The sponsor reported 29,400 dollars taken.", "t0": 5.41, "t1": 9.63, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "State grant account", "heading": "Reported amounts", "source": "review", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Stipends taken", "value": "$29,400"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "Employee repayment", "value": "$3,900"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.82, 1.33, 2.02, 2.63, 2.97, 3.27, 3.72]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The employee repaid 3,900 dollars.", "t0": 9.75, "t1": 13.04, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Employee repayment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.75, 1.28, 1.58, 2.08, 2.39, 2.71]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The sponsor replaced the client funds.", "t0": 13.16, "t1": 15.38, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Sponsor replaced the stipends"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.82, 1.28, 1.38, 1.73]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The sponsor said it terminated the employee and filed a police report and an insurance claim.", "t0": 15.5, "t1": 21.13, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "updated", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst", "text": "Fiscal monitoring", "mark": "Fiscal monitoring"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.73, 0.96, 1.08, 1.69, 1.81, 2.77, 3.09, 3.48, 3.55, 3.9, 4.43, 4.67, 4.77, 5.25]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "On October 13 the Controller placed the sponsor in Tier 2 after four unresolved findings.", "t0": 21.25, "t1": 28.12, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Four unresolved findings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.68, 1.66, 1.83, 2.33, 2.65, 2.75, 3.27, 3.42, 3.79, 4.46, 4.86, 5.36, 6.16]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City separately proposed a loan for acquisition and rehabilitation of 23 housing units.", "t0": 28.34, "t1": 34.5, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "housing", "kicker": "San Francisco Mayor’s Office of Housing and Community Development", "text": "Housing loan proposal", "mark": "Housing loan proposal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.59, 1.15, 1.7, 1.79, 2.12, 2.3, 2.91, 3.06, 4.53, 4.72, 5.32, 5.74]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The loan combined housing bond funds and bridge financing.", "t0": 34.62, "t1": 38.03, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Proposed financing", "heading": "Two sources", "source": "housing", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Housing bond funds", "value": "$15 million"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Bridge financing", "value": "$850,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.5, 1.01, 1.42, 1.74, 2.2, 2.35, 2.7]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The proposed loan was up to 15.85 million dollars.", "t0": 38.15, "t1": 42.53, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$15.85 million", "label": "Proposed housing loan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.75, 1.07, 1.25, 1.4, 1.55, 2.26, 2.63, 2.97, 3.43, 3.83]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "On November 18 the Budget and Finance Committee recommended the loan.", "t0": 42.65, "t1": 46.46, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "docket", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "November 18", "mark": "November 18"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.55, 1.22, 1.41, 1.73, 1.85, 2.27, 2.67, 3.23, 3.35]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Clerk listed a December 1 Board packet.", "t0": 46.58, "t1": 49.62, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "December 1 Board packet"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.66, 1.15, 1.24, 1.84, 2.27, 2.59]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The November 25 record does not establish final Board approval or disbursement.", "t0": 49.74, "t1": 54.65, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Final Board action", "Loan draws"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.57, 1.11, 1.67, 1.96, 2.23, 2.81, 3.15, 3.36, 3.87, 4.2]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 54.77, "t1": 57.35, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.9, 1.08, 1.38, 1.46, 1.56, 1.82, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The stipend account", "housing": "A separate housing proposal"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "contrast"}